{"recordId":"general_鄧世昌_915423814","name":"鄧世昌","type":"general","dynasty":"清朝","title":"致遠艦長","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"邓世昌","pageId":75951,"revisionId":94110381,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-30T17:47:48Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%82%93%E4%B8%96%E6%98%8C","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94110381","wikidataId":"Q716227","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"清史稿/卷460","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E5%8F%B2%E7%A8%BF%2F%E5%8D%B7460","origin":"literal-wikitext-link","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T11:03:59.818Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:qingshigao"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-dfad45109e762491","query":"鄧世昌","count":1,"offset":28258,"excerpt":"。庚辰，命兵部侍郎王文錦等辦理團練。辛巳，免陝西咸寧等處旱荒田賦。壬午，海軍副將鄧世昌及日人戰於大東溝，死之。癸未，召張之洞來京。丁亥，賑瑞昌等縣潦災。戊子，以臨敵潰散，罷葉志超、衛汝貴統領，以聶士成統兩軍。庚子，日兵渡鴨綠江。辛丑，陷九連城。壬","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-46ca14d7681433d0","query":"鄧世昌","count":3,"offset":30,"excerpt":"〔篇題：卷四百六十〕\n\n列傳二百四十七\n\n左寶貴弟寶賢等永山鄧世昌劉步蟾林泰曾等戴宗騫\n\n左寶貴\n\n左寶貴，字冠廷，山東費人。咸豐初，隸江南軍。嘗令當前敵，陣既接，旗兵中砲，殪，寶貴持其幟衝鋒入，大捷，繇是知名。獲苗沛霖，克金","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-005c4d8dcff9d1d9","query":"鄧世昌","count":1,"offset":430,"excerpt":"、鴨綠江口。定遠為汝昌座船，戰既酣，擊沉其西京丸一艘。已，致遠彈藥盡，被擊，總兵鄧世昌戰死。自是連喪五艦，不復能軍。汝昌猶立望樓督戰，忽座船砲震，暈而仆，舁以下。汝昌鑑世昌之死，慮諸將以輕生為烈，因定海軍懲勸章程，李鴻​​章上之，著為令。旅順陷，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-5421328ce2b75a02","query":"鄧世昌","count":1,"offset":4015,"excerpt":"，朝命海軍護送陸軍赴大東溝登岸援朝鮮，日本海軍來襲，我鐵艦十，當敵艦十有二。副將鄧世昌管帶致遠，都司陳金揆副之；參將黃建勳管帶超勇；參將林履中管帶揚威；經遠，則永昇主之。永昇夙與世昌等以忠義相激勵，既合諸艦，衝鋒轟擊，沉日艦三，卒以敵軍船快砲快為","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:qingshigao-dfad45109e762491","bookId":"book:qingshigao","requestedTitle":"清史稿/卷23","title":"清史稿/卷23","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E5%8F%B2%E7%A8%BF%2F%E5%8D%B723","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2132469","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E5%8F%B2%E7%A8%BF%2F%E5%8D%B723?action=history","revisionId":2132469,"revisionTimestamp":"2022-05-08T04:06:25Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:59:07.657Z","sha256":"22f06119d2256f757a8726d89a1cea1b970a1861c375f1f581ea4ebb2baf134c","textSha256":"5f593de2d738f6cd1ef14993f00396c229d579ca7a2da14e86df3e6a4366099f","expandedWikitextSha256":"22f06119d2256f757a8726d89a1cea1b970a1861c375f1f581ea4ebb2baf134c","characters":29444,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/qingshigao.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:46.613Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/0203e7829f5124f0c03e.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/0203e7829f5124f0c03e.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:qingshigao-46ca14d7681433d0","bookId":"book:qingshigao","requestedTitle":"清史稿/卷460","title":"清史稿/卷460","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85